luding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{9}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "94411761-2d88-5df5-8505-a294cf536d48" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "94411761-2d88-5df5-8505-a294cf536d48" :question/answer-fields "31ac8fd8-16f5-5bd2-bc65-b930f1aa88a5"] [:db/ensure "94411761-2d88-5df5-8505-a294cf536d48" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "94411761-2d88-5df5-8505-a294cf536d48"] [:db/add "902e9d2f-da61-56d9-a394-07942827d996" :answer/id #uuid "902e9d2f-da61-56d9-a394-07942827d996"] [:db/add "902e9d2f-da61-56d9-a394-07942827d996" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "902e9d2f-da61-56d9-a394-07942827d996" :answer/value "3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "902e9d2f-da61-56d9-a394-07942827d996" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1667a688-8c85-54f0-90b4-dc6cdbcaa7a0" :answer/id #uuid "1667a688-8c85-54f0-90b4-dc6cdbcaa7a0"] [:db/add "1667a688-8c85-54f0-90b4-dc6cdbcaa7a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1667a688-8c85-54f0-90b4-dc6cdbcaa7a0" :answer/value "48 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "1667a688-8c85-54f0-90b4-dc6cdbcaa7a0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7cb9db03-1e85-5618-8e12-ca19f8b293ee" :answer/id #uuid "7cb9db03-1e85-5618-8e12-ca19f8b293ee"] [:db/add "7cb9db03-1e85-5618-8e12-ca19f8b293ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7cb9db03-1e85-5618-8e12-ca19f8b293ee" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arc