-54bf-b159-2136cba40925" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{12}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "17f981ff-10d7-54bf-b159-2136cba40925" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{12}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "17f981ff-10d7-54bf-b159-2136cba40925" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "17f981ff-10d7-54bf-b159-2136cba40925" :question/answer-fields "c6f88d00-5b4b-5e4d-86d6-cdb2a46eac26"] [:db/ensure "17f981ff-10d7-54bf-b159-2136cba40925" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "17f981ff-10d7-54bf-b159-2136cba40925"] [:db/add "8b63614e-3f43-5c17-b02a-aeb28b077369" :answer/id #uuid "8b63614e-3f43-5c17-b02a-aeb28b077369"] [:db/add "8b63614e-3f43-5c17-b02a-aeb28b077369" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8b63614e-3f43-5c17-b02a-aeb28b077369" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "8b63614e-3f43-5c17-b02a-aeb28b077369" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71fd978f-e85a-5cb5-abbd-59faa3872c60" :answer/id #uuid "71fd978f-e85a-5cb5-abbd-59faa3872c60"] [