es\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{6}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7b036c6d-9389-560a-96d5-6ca7e6666fd4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7b036c6d-9389-560a-96d5-6ca7e6666fd4" :question/answer-fields "0d354d7a-2f69-52c9-ae0d-acf3d2839c10"] [:db/ensure "7b036c6d-9389-560a-96d5-6ca7e6666fd4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "7b036c6d-9389-560a-96d5-6ca7e6666fd4"] [:db/add "5b37f7db-f7da-5338-b9e3-09c63c6aaafd" :answer/id #uuid "5b37f7db-f7da-5338-b9e3-09c63c6aaafd"] [:db/add "5b37f7db-f7da-5338-b9e3-09c63c6aaafd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5b37f7db-f7da-5338-b9e3-09c63c6aaafd" :answer/value "32 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "5b37f7db-f7da-5338-b9e3-09c63c6aaafd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a7bc42a0-6902-5dbc-a113-71bce97ae6f7" :answer/id #uuid "a7bc42a0-6902-5dbc-a113-71bce97ae6f7"] [:db/add "a7bc42a0-6902-5dbc-a113-71bce97ae6f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a7bc42a0-6902-5dbc-a113-71bce97ae6f7" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "a7bc42a0-6902-5dbc-a113-71bce97ae6f7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1cda0fb1-f6b9-56d9-a0cb-fe0ddde59daf" :answer/id #uuid "1cda0fb1-f6b9-56d9-a0cb-fe0ddde59daf"] [:db/add "1cda0fb1-f6b9-56d9-a0cb-fe0ddde59daf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1cda0fb1-f6b9-56d9-a0cb-fe0ddde59daf" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "