\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "9c62b7c1-d83e-524c-b149-3e27855b6d10" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $8\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{8}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9c62b7c1-d83e-524c-b149-3e27855b6d10" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "9c62b7c1-d83e-524c-b149-3e27855b6d10" :question/answer-fields "486e3b2a-d2fa-5351-b8c3-e2d7d5620280"] [:db/ensure "9c62b7c1-d83e-524c-b149-3e27855b6d10" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "9c62b7c1-d83e-524c-b149-3e27855b6d10"] [:db/add "f18e9ad7-918f-59d4-8d8f-1aed28490acd" :answer/id #uuid "f18e9ad7-918f-59d4-8d8f-1aed28490acd"] [:db/add "f18e9ad7-918f-59d4-8d8f-1aed28490acd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f18e9ad7-918f-59d4-8d8f-1aed28490acd" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "f18e9ad7-918f-59d4-8d8f-1aed28490acd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "51cf3a42-5e1e-54d5-b06e-4a4474b93caa" :answer/id #uuid "51cf3a42-5e1e-54d5-b06e-4a4474b93caa"] [:db/add "51cf3a42-5e1e-54d5-b06e-4a4474b93caa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "51c