nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "50d35185-4309-5e44-8978-17037e3c7532" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "50d35185-4309-5e44-8978-17037e3c7532" :question/answer-fields "bbcf2353-e122-5e59-ac5e-0516a34593f9"] [:db/ensure "50d35185-4309-5e44-8978-17037e3c7532" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "50d35185-4309-5e44-8978-17037e3c7532"] [:db/add "60224618-5dd7-50a2-b29c-9789c6571853" :answer/id #uuid "60224618-5dd7-50a2-b29c-9789c6571853"] [:db/add "60224618-5dd7-50a2-b29c-9789c6571853" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "60224618-5dd7-50a2-b29c-9789c6571853" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "60224618-5dd7-50a2-b29c-9789c6571853" :answer/validate] [:db/add "06c1dc1d-91f1-5cdc-9af9-335624bcb5de" :answer/id #uuid "06c1dc1d-91f1-5cdc-9af9-335624bcb5de"] [:db/add "06c1dc1d-91f1-5cdc-9af9-335624bcb5de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "06c1dc1d-91f1-5cdc-9af9-335624bcb5de" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "06c1dc1d-91f1-5cdc-9af9-335624bcb5de" :answer/validate] [:db/add "785e4bff-ed0d-571e-8e30-ad6068a66947" :answer/id #uuid "785e4bff-ed0d-571e-8e30-ad6068a66947"] [:db/add "785e4bff-ed0d-571e-8e30-ad6068a66947" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "785e4bff-ed0d-571e