"1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea"] [:db/add "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{2}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea" :question/answer-fields "bb7b3bf0-2b97-5a9d-ad71-aaaaea3b3272"] [:db/ensure "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "1364fb88-73ca-58a6-8d3f-19c6703f9eea"] [:db/add "f83b25bc-8980-5e2e-976c-9402d33821c1" :answer/id #uuid "f83b25bc-8980-5e2e-976c-9402d33821c1"] [:db/add "f83b25bc-8980-5e2e-976c-9402d33821c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f83b25bc-8980-5e2e-976c-9402d33821c1" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "f83b25bc-8980-5e2e-976c-9402d33821c1" :answer/validate