end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "331600d2-2972-5af6-8d93-8b33ff7a111f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "331600d2-2972-5af6-8d93-8b33ff7a111f" :question/answer-fields "b0360637-96c1-57f9-a909-36cc62285a42"] [:db/ensure "331600d2-2972-5af6-8d93-8b33ff7a111f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "331600d2-2972-5af6-8d93-8b33ff7a111f"] [:db/add "d7f1d58b-77fd-58ea-9fd2-39f9c5c0567e" :answer/id #uuid "d7f1d58b-77fd-58ea-9fd2-39f9c5c0567e"] [:db/add "d7f1d58b-77fd-58ea-9fd2-39f9c5c0567e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d7f1d58b-77fd-58ea-9fd2-39f9c5c0567e" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "d7f1d58b-77fd-58ea-9fd2-39f9c5c0567e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "067c0507-9733-5674-b108-cd3cde50cbb1" :answer/id #uuid "067c0507-9733-5674-b108-cd3cde50cbb1"] [:db/add "067c0507-9733-5674-b108-cd3cde50cbb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "067c0507-9733-5674-b108-cd3cde50cbb1" :answer/value "\\frac{6 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "067c0507-9733-5674-b108-cd3cde50cbb1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "47df20ad-fd10-51f5-bbd3-3362944d50d1" :answer/id #uuid "47df20ad-fd10-51f5-bbd3-3362944d50d1"] [:db/add "47df20ad-fd10-51f5-bbd3-3362944d50d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "47df20ad-fd10-51f5-bbd3-3362944d50d1" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{10}+C"] [:db/ensure "47df20ad-fd10-51f5-bbd3-3362944d50d1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "518eb03e-a960-538d-b733-631ba80