connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "fd57317c-a856-5b24-aea7-22feeb608f61" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "fd57317c-a856-5b24-aea7-22feeb608f61" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "fd57317c-a856-5b24-aea7-22feeb608f61" :question/answer-fields "d9711823-1638-5564-a5da-2ba3b2401714"] [:db/ensure "fd57317c-a856-5b24-aea7-22feeb608f61" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "fd57317c-a856-5b24-aea7-22feeb608f61"] [:db/add "7ed5f2a0-7ba0-58b4-9bb6-0b5eabe66d1f" :answer/id #uuid "7ed5f2a0-7ba0-58b4-9bb6-0b5eabe66d1f"] [:db/add "7ed5f2a0-7ba0-58b4-9bb6-0b5eabe66d1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7ed5f2a0-7ba0-58b4-9bb6-0b5eabe66d1f" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "7ed5f2a0-7ba0-58b4-9bb6-0b5eabe66d1f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "37fde0ec-e549-5b39-a410-86e403fd8f8b" :answer/id #uuid "37fde0ec-e549-5b39-a410-86e403fd8f8b"] [:db/add "37fde0ec-e549-5b39-a410-86e403fd8f8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "37fde0ec-e549-