ause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c094c2bf-b6f8-56b7-b16d-d60f918a0033" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c094c2bf-b6f8-56b7-b16d-d60f918a0033" :question/answer-fields "8a9046a2-da30-5758-8c65-cb5f5a37b112"] [:db/ensure "c094c2bf-b6f8-56b7-b16d-d60f918a0033" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "c094c2bf-b6f8-56b7-b16d-d60f918a0033"] [:db/add "87a7cd3d-a3e1-57ef-bd90-ebab57ee2dc1" :answer/id #uuid "87a7cd3d-a3e1-57ef-bd90-ebab57ee2dc1"] [:db/add "87a7cd3d-a3e1-57ef-bd90-ebab57ee2dc1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "87a7cd3d-a3e1-57ef-bd90-ebab57ee2dc1" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "87a7cd3d-a3e1-57ef-bd90-ebab57ee2dc1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "300f54c1-5299-5f59-8c29-08ce3b7cc164" :answer/id #uuid "300f54c1-5299-5f59-8c29-08ce3b7cc164"] [:db/add "300f54c1-5299-5f59-8c29-08ce3b7cc164" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "300f54c1-5299-5f59-8c29-08ce3b7cc164" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "300f54c1-5299-5f59-8c29-08ce3b7cc164" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f0744503-ead9-5216-83c5-8926650d34c9" :answer/id #uuid "f0744503-ead9-5216-83c5-8926650d34c9"] [:db/add "f0744503-ead9-5216-83c5-8926650d34c9" :answer/type :an