613ad487f68" :question/id #uuid "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68"] [:db/add "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68" :question/answer-fields "32d2a48e-b686-5e89-89e8-8396d60d6ce0"] [:db/ensure "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "af0cf89b-f732-5f0a-8c57-8613ad487f68"] [:db/add "8ee17bcb-4531-5ee8-a509-c59995daf3b8" :answer/id #uuid "8ee17bcb-4531-5ee8-a509-c59995daf3b8"] [:db/add "8ee17bcb-4531-5ee8-a509-c59995daf3b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ee17bcb-4531-5ee8-a509-c59995daf3b8" :answer/value "4 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "8ee17bcb-4531-5ee8-a509-c59995daf3b8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ae9ae31-199b-58a8-ba1b-f2edb8a31e