$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "40535664-b254-5fbc-9804-105826e8c76d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "40535664-b254-5fbc-9804-105826e8c76d" :question/answer-fields "5399cf86-4c7f-531f-a4de-54a59dcf44a1"] [:db/ensure "40535664-b254-5fbc-9804-105826e8c76d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "40535664-b254-5fbc-9804-105826e8c76d"] [:db/add "b7875ff8-8cbd-5de4-86b5-367eca7f1004" :answer/id #uuid "b7875ff8-8cbd-5de4-86b5-367eca7f1004"] [:db/add "b7875ff8-8cbd-5de4-86b5-367eca7f1004" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b7875ff8-8cbd-5de4-86b5-367eca7f1004" :answer/value "3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "b7875ff8-8cbd-5de4-86b5-367eca7f1004" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f575d29f-a637-5a7d-b921-3db38cf12b5a" :answer/id #uuid "f575d29f-a637-5a7d-b921-3db38cf12b5a"] [:db/add "f575d29f-a637-5a7d-b921-3db38cf12b5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f575d29f-a637-5a7d-b921-3db38cf12b5a" :answer/value "48 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "f575d29f-a637-5a7d-b921-3db38cf12b5a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7a7bca67-1f1c-5cef-8c95-457054e7ee2c" :answer/id #uuid "7